# Startup Idea Exchange - Phased Implementation Plan

This plan details the technical execution of the **Startup Idea Exchange** platform, divided into four logical phases. AI integration is deferred to a later stage.

## Phase 1: Foundation [COMPLETE] ✅
**Goal**: Core infrastructure, Auth, and Design System.

### [Phase 1 Components]

#### [NEW] [Database Architecture]
- Implementation of the initial schema using **PostgreSQL**.
- Setup **Prisma ORM** for type-safe database access.

#### [NEW] [Authentication System]
- Integration of **NextAuth.js** (or similar) into the Express/React stack.
- Environment variables for `SECRET_KEY`, `OAuth` credentials.

#### [NEW] [UI Design System]
- Core Tailwind configuration with custom palette.
- Base layout components (`Navbar`, `Sidebar`, `Footer`).

---

## Phase 2: Idea Marketplace
**Goal**: Enable posting and browsing of startup ideas.
- API design for Idea CRUD operations.
- Marketplace feed with filtering.

---

## Phase 3: Collaboration & Networking
**Goal**: Match founders and enable communication.
- Cofounder matching logic.
- Real-time chat infrastructure.

---

## Phase 4: Monetization & Admin
**Goal**: Payments, Admin panel, and educational content.
- Stripe/Payment gateway integration.
- Admin dashboard for moderation.

## Verification & Deployment Strategy

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Deployment to production will occur at the **completion of each Phase** rather than every minor change. This ensures each deployment brings a stable, testable set of features.

### Phase 1 Verification
1.  **Local Development**: Verify Auth flow and UI responsiveness.
2.  **Staging Deploy**: push to VPS and verify `https://startupideaexcahnge.in` accessibility with working login.
